  "descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "Repositorio central de datasets geospaciais, culturais e juridicos do projeto Atlas Vivo MILK, contendo documentacao legal fundacional da Associacao MILK para preservacao do patrimonio cultural imaterial portugues. Este repositorio e parte do ecossistema de dados abertos da Associacao MILK, alinhado com os padroes FAIR, EUPL-1.2, e as diretrizes da Comissao Europeia para interoperabilidade de dados culturais e geoespaciais.",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract",
      "lang": "pt"
    },
    {
      "description": "Central repository of geospatial, cultural, and legal datasets for the MILK Living Atlas project, containing foundational legal documentation of the MILK Association for the preservation of Portuguese intangible cultural heritage. This repository is part of the MILK Association's open data ecosystem, aligned with FAIR principles, EUPL-1.2, and the European Commission's guidelines for cultural and geospatial data interoperability.",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract",
      "lang": "en"
    }
  ],
